description:
1. The main purpose of the website: E-commerce, specifically a beauty and personal care products store.
2. Primary products or content offered: Bath & body care, face & skincare, haircare, makeup, fragrance, gifts, and summer essentials.
3. Target audience or industry: Beauty-conscious consumers, possibly targeting individuals with dry or sensitive skin, and those looking for natural and cruelty-free products.
4. Notable features:
* Product categorization by product type, skin type, concern, and range;
* Product collections (e.g., Refreshing Passionfruit Collection);
* Refill options for certain products; 
* A "Bestsellers" section highlighting popular products;
* A "FREE SKINCARE GIFT WHEN YOU SPEND £45" promotion.
